{'symbol': 'CI', 'date': '2022-04-27 16:49:00', 'title': 'CIGNA DECLARES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND', 'text': 'BLOOMFIELD, CONN. , APRIL 27, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF CIGNA CORPORATION (NYSE: CI) TODAY DECLARED A CASH DIVIDEND OF\xa0$1.12 PER SHARE OF CIGNA COMMON STOCK, PAYABLE ON\xa0JUNE 23, 2022 TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON\xa0JUNE 8, 2022.'}